  "description": "NAJMEU crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C48 H40 N8 O40 Si8 Tb4 4-,4(C24 H20 P1 1+),10(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.712-3.737 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 106.13-106.63°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula (Ph4P)4[(PhSiO1.5)8(TbO1.5)4(O)2(NO2.5)8]·10MeCN.",
